{
  "sourceLanguage" : "zh-Hant",
  "version" : "1.0",
  "strings" : {
    "%@ / %lld 秒" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ / %lld s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 到 %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ to %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 鈴聲" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ Ringtone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@延後 0.1 秒" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 0.1 s later"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@提早 0.1 秒" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 0.1 s earlier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 雲碟" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud Drive"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 雲碟無法使用，已存在這台 iPhone。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud Drive is unavailable, so it was saved on this iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 雲碟：存在 iCloud 雲碟的「鈴聲剪輯」資料夾，其他 iPhone、iPad、Mac 也拿得到。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud Drive: saved in the Ringtone Cutter folder in iCloud Drive, available on your other iPhone, iPad and Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone 的鈴聲清單不會跨裝置同步：在另一台 iPhone 上，從「檔案」打開鈴聲，再點「用作鈴聲」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The iPhone ringtone list doesn’t sync between devices: on another iPhone, open the ringtone from Files and tap “Use as Ringtone”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下載" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Download"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下載中…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Downloading…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下載失敗：%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Download failed: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "伺服器回應錯誤（%lld），請確認連結是否仍然有效、已公開分享。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The server returned an error (%lld). Check that the link still works and is shared publicly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "停止試聽" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stop Preview"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "儲存位置" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Save Location"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "儲存位置說明" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "About Save Location"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "再次分享" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Share Again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "剪輯失敗：%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn’t make the ringtone: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在分享選單點「用作鈴聲」即可設定。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In the share sheet, tap “Use as Ringtone”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "好" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已存到 iCloud 雲碟「%@」" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saved to iCloud Drive as “%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已存成「%@」" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saved as “%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "找不到 https 開頭的網址。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No link starting with https was found."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "換一首" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Change Song"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "支援 Google 雲端硬碟、Dropbox、OneDrive 的公開分享連結，以及 S3 等可以直接下載的網址。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Works with public share links from Google Drive, Dropbox and OneDrive, and with direct download links such as S3."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "支援 MP3、M4A、AAC、WAV、AIFF、FLAC、ALAC、Opus、AC-3，以及 MP4、MOV 影片的聲音" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Works with MP3, M4A, AAC, WAV, AIFF, FLAC, ALAC, Opus and AC-3, plus the sound from MP4 and MOV videos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "檔案超過 500 MB，請改用較小的檔案。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The file is larger than 500 MB. Please use a smaller file."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此 iOS 版本無法直接設為鈴聲（需 iOS 26）。檔案會存在「檔案」App 的「鈴聲剪輯」資料夾。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This iOS version can’t set ringtones directly (iOS 26 required). The file is saved in the Ringtone Cutter folder in the Files app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "淡入淡出" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fade In & Out"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "無法讀取「%@」。WMA、WebM、MKV 等格式請先轉成 MP3 或 M4A。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn’t read “%@”. Formats such as WMA, WebM and MKV need converting to MP3 or M4A first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "無法讀取這支影片" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
