    "貼上連結" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Paste a Link"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這個名稱會顯示在 iPhone 的鈴聲清單中" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This name appears in your iPhone’s ringtone list"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這個連結打開的是網頁，不是檔案。請確認已設為「知道連結的人都能檢視」，或改貼直接下載的網址。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This link opens a web page, not a file. Make sure it’s shared with “Anyone with the link”, or paste a direct download link instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這個音檔格式無法轉換" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This audio format can’t be converted"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台 iPhone" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台 iPhone：存在「檔案」→「我的 iPhone」→「鈴聲剪輯」。刪除 App 時會一起刪除。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This iPhone: saved in Files → On My iPhone → Ringtone Cutter, and removed if you delete the app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "選一首歌，剪下 30 秒以內的片段" : {
      "localizations" : {
